  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed first floor side to rear extension, by reason of its incompatible design (roof), excessive scale (height/depth/bulk/mass) would give rise to an overly dominant, incongruous, unsympathetic&amp;nbsp;design that results in a bulky and contrived form of development that fails to respect the character, composition and design of the host dwelling and prevailing pattern of development in within the area.&amp;nbsp; As such, the proposal falls contrary to Policies D3 of the ‘London Plan’ (2021), Policy GR1 of the London Borough of Harrow ‘New Local Plan’ (2021-2041) and guidance contained within the Councils adopted Supplementary Planning Document: entitled ‘Residential Design’ (2010) and guidance contained within the ‘National Planning Policy Framework’ (2024)."
